Package: gwg
Architecture: any
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 iproute2,
 iptables,
 procps,
 sudo,
 systemd,
 wireguard-tools
Description: command-line manager for WireGuard servers
 gwg initializes and administers a WireGuard server, manages peers,
 displays transfer statistics and configures per-peer traffic limits.
 .
 Installing this package only installs the gwg executable and its runtime
 dependencies. Server configuration is performed explicitly by gwg init.
